+
+$$
+\mathcal M_n=\sup_{c\in(0,\infty)^n}\lambda_2(L(c))R_n(c),\qquad
+\mathcal A_n=\{c\in(0,\infty)^n:
+\lambda_2(L(c))R_n(c)=\mathcal M_n\}.
+$$
